      "reviewed_source_excerpts": [
        "For a\nnormalized vector in $\\bigcap_{j=1}^N D(a_j)$, define its mean total number\nby the quadratic form $n_N(\\psi):=\\sum_{j=1}^N\\|a_j\\psi\\|^2$.",
        "Each factor is a Schwartz Gaussian, so the product is in every $D(a_j)$.\nBy the explicitly defined total-number form, the finite sum therefore gives\n$$n_N(\\Psi_N)=\\sum_{j=1}^N\\|a_j\\Psi_N\\|^2=N\\sinh^2(s).$$"
      ]
